  displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a7e3747d102e9840aa0bcab49542a9f, type: 3}
  displayText: 'Pool balls are numbered 1 to 15. Add them up, bonus points for coming
    up with a fast way to do so. Hint: average two numbers. How can they be equal?'
  solutionImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a7e3747d102e9840aa0bcab49542a9f, type: 3}
  solutionText: '120 <br> Fastest method involves adding highest and lowest number:
    <br> Average(15+1)=16/2  <br> 8*15 balls is 120'
